  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The development, would be reason of its height, bulk and massing, cause harm to the setting of the adjacent Grade II listed Quaker Meeting House and the wider Wandsworth Town Conservation Area. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Policies LP1 and LP3 of the Wandsworth Local Plan 2023 and Policy HC1 of the London Plan 2021. \r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - The development, would by reason of its height and massing, cause a loss of outlook, an increased sense of enclosure, and a loss of privacy to neighbouring residential development. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Policies LP1 and LP2 of the Wandsworth Local Plan 2023. ",
    "Reason : 3 - The development, would by reason of providing inadequate external amenity space, lead to the development of sub-standard residential units. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Policy LP27 of the Wandsworth Local Plan 2023. \r\n",
    "Reason : 4 - The development would lead to the loss of 430sq.m of Class F2 floorspace, leading to a loss of social and community facilities. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Policy LP17 of the Local Plan. "
  ],
